label "Agents as tools diagram"
box caller 14 60 106 100 "calling agent|keeps the loop"
box t1 160 26 100 34 "search tool"
box agtool 160 90 100 40 "agent as tool" acc
box t3 160 160 100 34 "other tool"
region ctx 296 54 154 140 "own context window"
box inner 308 70 130 48 "specialist agent|own prompt + tools"
box res 308 140 130 40 "final result only"
arrow caller t1
arrow caller agtool both
arrow caller t3
arrow agtool inner
arrow inner res
arrow res agtool dashed
note "the caller keeps control; only the final result comes back"
